[{"id": "a519269b-69fb-4679-bf29-9359a948ba65", "name": "仙子的修行", "cover": "https://nr2.deepsese.net/characters/a519269b-69fb-4679-bf29-9359a948ba65/covers/1790653977528-53bb7d43-da42-4c2f-8c4e-c4cc13dd2cae/original.webp?v=1790653977528-53bb7d43-da42-4c2f-8c4e-c4cc13dd2cae", "src": "yy", "cat": "群像", "tags": ["仙侠", "修真", "群像", "分章原著", "太上忘情", "旁观视角"], "intro": "《仙子的修行》原著分章演绎。115 章正文加 30 章番外浴房篇。", "persona": "@keyframes yxSheen{0%{transform:translateX(-30%);opacity:0}18%{opacity:1}62%{opacity:1}100%{transform:translateX(32%);opacity:0}\n\n@keyframes yxBreath{0%,100%{transform:scale(.86);opacity:.35}50%{transform:scale(1.06);opacity:.62}\n\n@keyframes yxShine{0%{transform:translateX(0)}100%{transform:translateX(340%)}}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.yx::before,.yx::after,.yx-name::after,.yx-pick,.yx-btn,.yx-sel{animation:none}\n\n@media (min-width:769px){\n\n#yxp1:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"1\"],\n#yxp2:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"2\"],\n#yxp3:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"3\"],\n#yxp4:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"4\"],\n#yxp5:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"5\"],\n#yxp6:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"6\"],\n#yxp7:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"7\"],\n#yxp8:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"8\"],\n#yxp9:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"9\"],\n#yxp10:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"10\"],\n#yxp11:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"11\"],\n#yxp12:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"12\"],\n#yxp13:checked ~ .yx-pages [data-p=\"13\"],\n#yxp14:checke…", "scenario": "", "openings": ["仙者，入山长生。\n\n九州大陆，仙山林立。世人皆以拜入仙门为荣，稍次一等，也要习武学艺，携刀带剑行走江湖，盼着哪天以武入道，再登仙门。\n\n这一日，五大仙门之一的仙云宗前殿山脚下，挤满了人。\n\n儒衫书生、粗布麻衣的屠夫、抱着剑神情高傲的侠客、坐在轿子里足不沾地的千金小姐，全仰着头往山顶看。云雾缭绕处，隐约可见一座宏伟的大殿坐落云端，那气势让人心头发热。\n\n五年一次的收徒之日，凡人一生能有几个五年。\n\n山脚下的人越聚越多，摩擦不断，骂声、笑声、叫卖声混成一片。所有人都在等山顶那扇门开。\n\n山道旁那处阴影里，一直站着一个人。\n\n从头到尾，没有谁朝那边看过一眼——连稍后落到场中的那位中年男子，神识扫过全场时，也从那个方向掠了过去，像掠过一块石头。\n\n那人也不出声。就那样站着，把这一日从头看到了尾。\n\n 下一步选择 李仙仙 轩辕明珠 杨七 萧远 南宫婉 李老汉 白鹤仙 金文韵 赵青青 赵小青 赵小蓝 王大富 秦红莲 笑酒仙 后土娘娘"], "gallery": ["https://nr2.deepsese.net/characters/a519269b-69fb-4679-bf29-9359a948ba65/bg_image.webp?v=1790663224228-dad0df7c-df2e-4170-850a-61524215f9aa", "https://nr2.deepsese.net/characters/a519269b-69fb-4679-bf29-9359a948ba65/bg_mobile.webp?v=1790653986006-6a55c7bb-d2ce-45d4-914c-8f51414cdaf1"]}]